BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:state-pte-connecticut-2025-03-17@ustaxcalendar.com
DTSTAMP:20260924T122623Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20250317
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20250318
SUMMARY:Connecticut: CT-1065/CT-1120SI due
DESCRIPTION:Connecticut partnership/S-corp composite return due the 15th da
 y of the 3rd month after year-end. Connecticut's PE Tax (elective as of 202
 4) is reported on this same return series. Correction (this rebuild session
 ): the cited source states the general rule (15th day of the 3rd month) wit
 hout addressing the 2026-specific weekend interaction - March 15\, 2026 is 
 a Sunday. Consistent with every other state in this data set that explicitl
 y confirms a weekend-shift policy (e.g. Massachusetts\, New York\, Vermont\
 , Delaware\, Montana\, Oregon all confirm shifting to March 16\, 2026)\, an
 d with the near-universal US government-deadline convention of shifting to 
 the next business day\, this entry's date_2026 was corrected from an unshif
 ted March 15\, 2026 to March 16\, 2026. This is a computed application of t
