SUMMARY:Connecticut: State sales & use tax return due
DESCRIPTION:Form OS-114 due last day of month following the reporting perio
 d (same rule for monthly and quarterly filers). | Q1 2026 (Jan-Mar) sales t
 ax return\, applying Connecticut's quarterly-filer due-date rule: Form OS-1
 14 due last day of month following the reporting period (same rule for mont
 hly and quarterly filers). This is a representative recurring pattern\, not
  a single annual deadline - actual filing frequency (monthly/quarterly/annu
 al) is assigned per business by the state. | Authority: Direct fetch of Con
 necticut's own tax agency site this session | Source: https://portal.ct.gov
